						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Monday, July 29, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Hosting Problems </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							There was a problem with the hosting company they moved the site to a new server and set our databases to readonly.<BR><BR>All fixed now, you should be able to submit News, Sale Items, or sign up for an account.<BR><BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Ganza<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=291">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, July 10, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Under new  </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Guild "Avalanche of Power" is under "new" management. We completely restructured Avalanche and changed it's purpose. All information is posted on our website.<BR><BR>You can find us at<BR><BR>www.geocities.com/AvalancheSolRo<BR><BR>Thank you. 
							<br><BR>
							 - Flaor<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=287">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=287">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, July 09, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Lords of Prophecy </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							"Lords of Prophecy" became oficial Solusek Ro guild on Sunday July 07, 2002.<BR><BR>Lords of Prophecy is L56+ guild with limited roster. Guild leader - Flaor McLife, level 60 shaman of Tribunal.<BR><BR>"Lords of Prophecy" is a products of Enigma project of "Spartans" team.<BR><BR>Our website can be founs at<BR>http://www.geocities.com/enigmasolro<BR><BR>You can contact me at flaor@msn.com
							<br><BR>
							 - Flaor<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=286">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=286">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, July 05, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Do not get riped off by Koru </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							I recently wanted to come back to EQ so I started looking for a character to purchase.  I finally found one, a level 60 warrior named Koru.  I sent an XBox and eight games to the guy for the acount.  After I got the account I played it for a few days, all this time people are accusing me of hacking the account.  I eventually found out the account was stolen and then sold to me.  I was also locked out of the account and could not get back in.  Luckily I got the sellers number from someone in the game and called him... his dad picked up the phone.  His fater was unaware his son was selling stolen accounts and he did not know his son had an XBox.  Well, the guy mailed me my XBox back, but now I had half the number of games I sent, he traded some he said.  I also lost out on the shipping cost I paid to send the heavy XBox, and I had made a few characters on the account I purchased, which I lost also.  Mind you, these characters were loaded with good items like FBSS, Centi Longsword, and other items.  I messaged Koru in the game and he told me that his little brother deleted the characters with their items... yet within five minutes I saw one of the characters I made online.  So, thus the seller and the other guy who said he was the origional owner are both liars.  Do not buy a level 60 dwarf named Koru, he is not in full Warlord armor as advertised, he is nowhere near getting his epic, he does not have a good 2 hand slasher as advertised either.  Heck, at level 60 he has one of the worst haste items in the game.<BR>  The sellers name was Alan McGrath, so please be careful when you purchase or trade for any account.  I only posted here because I saw he was trying to ripoff someone else.  Good luck to all.
							<br><BR>
							 - Zakk<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=285">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=285">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, July 04, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">I'm doing you all a favor and warning you not to b </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							He stole my account, no one , i repeat no one do trades with the "cronic."
							<br><BR>
							 - Drodan<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=283">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, July 02, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">60 shaman  </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							trading 60 shaman on fennin ro for a 55+ epic char on solusek ro , pm me , or email me tradenfor@Hotmail.com 
							<br><BR>
							 - shamguylvl60<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=282">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, June 19, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Searching? </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Greetings members of the hallowed and almighty Soulesk Ro Server as has been my home for the past two years.<BR><BR>I am now a member of a Guild called Forgotten Elite, and an officer non the less. We are currently recruiting people from around Norrath and Luclin, just look us up when your online if your interested or view our new forums at www.forgottenelite.com with a website soon to come! <BR><BR>All the best hunting and searching for what you want to find.
							<br><BR>
							 - Raktael - Officer of Forgotten Elite<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=281">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp;<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=281">[View Comments]</a>



					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, June 13, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">New Guild - Divine Sanction </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Guess what  another guild.  www.divinesanction.com we have been around for a bit and are established. We always welcom new members and a process is posted for application<BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Lassra<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=280">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, June 04, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">To low for Destiny is now recruiting! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Hey all of Norrath! How are you, sad were all to low for destiny? Well im putting together a guild to express ourselve, lol. Seriousily though, if you are interested in making this guild a good guild we could make a great guild. We could have a very organized infostructure as well as a great roster so if you wanna join send me an email at Johnrev2007@aol.com
							<br><BR>
							 - Vanna<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=279">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, May 31, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Luclin's Descendants Up! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Hail Fellow Norrathians! Solusek Ro has yet another new guild out and about. We are Luclin's Descendants. No level range as of yet, so send Stunch or Zhanzarist a tell in game if your interested. Were a guild looking to defy traditional guild rules,and go against the grain. E-mail ForestFrog59@aol.com if your interested in joining our ranks. Good hunting!<BR>Zhanzarist<BR>Luclin's Descendants<BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Zhanzarist<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=278">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
